## Example: Madam Groovy Limerence Article

**Thread:** https://discord.com/channels/1109630805409529916/1528933448369311745

**What the session did (following this skill exactly):**

| Phase | What happened | Result |
|---|---|---|
| 0 | Created NLM notebook, added 20 YouTube videos, ran deep research (40+ more), NLM curated | ~60 sources on limerence |
| 1 | Five NLM queries: topics, gaps, structure, semantic keywords, spokes | Gaps identified, 7-section structure recommended, 5 semantic variants surfaced |
| 2 | Loaded evergreen.md + SOUL.md + icp-profiles.md + reddit-pain-phrases.md | ICP: women 25-45 navigating heartbreak. Voice: wise, warm, ruthlessly clear |
| 3 | Comprehensive NLM prompt with all inputs + slippery slope + varied rhythm | 191-line pillar article with bracketed citations |
| 4 | Formatted and saved to `content/03-production/blog/taming-the-limerent-beast/ARTICLE-DRAFT.md` | Saved and verified |
| 5 | Verified keyword targeting, gaps covered, brand voice consistent | Ready for user review |

**Result:** Article titled "Taming the Limerent Beast: A Guide to Obsessive Love" targeting "limerence" (301K/mo, competition index 2).

